      "content": "thanks. you mentioned it's a \"positive step,\" but that sounds like you're taking a side. if i'm writing a report that needs to be objective, shouldn't i stay away from calling it \"positive\" and just report that it's a trend? \n\nalso, you said there's debate, but you didn't really say much about what the actual arguments are against it. it feels like you're just treating the \"debate\" as a footnote to the main point that it's a good thing. can you explain why someone would actually think this is a bad idea for a company?",
